      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight tracking-tight mb-4">Guides for growing your business online</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-2xl">Plain-English advice on website costs, conversions, and getting found on Google — written for Australian small businesses.</p>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <a href="/blog/7-website-mistakes-australia/" class="block border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-7 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2">Web Design · July 2026</p>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">7 Website Mistakes Australian Small Businesses Make (And How to Fix Them)</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Slow load times, no tap-to-call, PDF menus, missing Google reviews — the most common (and costly) website mistakes in 2026, with specific fixes for each.</p>
        </a>
