          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2">Pricing Guide</p>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">How much does a website cost in Australia? (2026)</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Real AUD figures for DIY, freelancer and agency websites — plus the ongoing costs most guides skip.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/signs-website-losing-customers/" class="block border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-7 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2">Conversion</p>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">5 signs your website is losing you customers</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Visitors but no enquiries? One of these five fixable issues is usually why — and how to fix each.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/small-business-website-checklist/" class="block border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-7 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2">Checklist</p>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">The small business website checklist (2026)</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Everything a small business website actually needs in 2026 — no jargon, no filler.</p>
        </a>
