          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2">Comparison</p>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">WordPress vs custom website: which is right for you?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Cost, speed, SEO, security and maintenance compared — an honest look at both for a small business.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/how-long-to-build-a-website/" class="block border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-7 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2">Guide</p>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">How long does it take to build a website?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Realistic timelines for a landing page, business site and e-commerce store — and what speeds it up.</p>
