        <a href="/blog/tradie-website-cost/" class="block border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-7 hover:border-gray-300 transition-colors">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2">Trades</p>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">How much does a tradie website cost in Australia?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Real 2026 pricing for plumbers, electricians and builders — plus what wins more jobs from Google.</p>
